<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves rates unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves rates unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it left its draining rate used to absorb funds from the money market and its emergency lending rate unchanged at 6.80 and 9.00 percent respectively.</p>
</text>
